# Fetish Shaman

**Alignments.** Any, but the spirits tend to avoid selfish people.

Also called the War Shaman. Like a Techno-Wizard he enchants objects rather than
casting spells - but he casts no spells at all, drawing instead on ties to the
spirits that let him use their bodies'' remains to make powerful fetishes, for
himself and for the needy and worthy. Skilled warriors dedicated to protecting
others, many serve as War Chiefs and as the avengers of the people, the spirits
and the gods.

## Lore

His fetishes are most often made and used in time of war, which is where the
class takes its other name. The book ranks the Fetish Shaman first in renown as
a war chief, ahead even of the Mystic Warrior, and marks each one with the
Steady-Hand and War tattoo fetishes.

## Equipment the catalog cannot hold yet

Ceremonial garments and a headdress or animal skin, a hooded cloak, moccasins,
a musical instrument of choice, a hand axe, 50 feet of rope, a week of dried
food and flint. A bow with 24 arrows, three S.D.C. weapons of choice, a mallet,
3D4 wooden stakes and a silver cross.
